<tr><td style="padding:32px 32px 8px;">
<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.25;color:#181818;">You're signed up for Event Setup</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;">Hi {{{FlowToolKit__Form_Submission__c.FlowToolKit__Contact1_First_Name__c}}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;">Thank you for volunteering at the Annual Foundation Gala. We received your sign-up and saved your spot on the setup crew.</p>
<h2 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:18px;color:#0b5cab;">What we received</h2>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#eef4ff;border-radius:8px;margin:0 0 24px;"><tr><td style="padding:10px 16px;color:#5c5c5c;font-size:14px;width:40%;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;">Name</td><td style="padding:10px 16px;color:#181818;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;">{{{FlowToolKit__Form_Submission__c.FlowToolKit__Contact1_First_Name__c}}} {{{FlowToolKit__Form_Submission__c.FlowToolKit__Contact1_Last_Name__c}}}</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:10px 16px;color:#5c5c5c;font-size:14px;width:40%;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;">Email</td><td style="padding:10px 16px;color:#181818;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;">{{{FlowToolKit__Form_Submission__c.FlowToolKit__Contact1_Email__c}}}</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:10px 16px;color:#5c5c5c;font-size:14px;width:40%;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;">Phone</td><td style="padding:10px 16px;color:#181818;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;">{{{FlowToolKit__Form_Submission__c.FlowToolKit__Contact1_Phone__c}}}</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:10px 16px;color:#5c5c5c;font-size:14px;width:40%;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;">Your shift</td><td style="padding:10px 16px;color:#181818;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;">{{{FlowToolKit__Form_Submission__c.FlowToolKit__Start_Date_Time__c}}}</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:10px 16px;color:#5c5c5c;font-size:14px;width:40%;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;">Guests joining you</td><td style="padding:10px 16px;color:#181818;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;">{{{FlowToolKit__Form_Submission__c.FlowToolKit__Number_of_Guests__c}}}</td></tr></table>
<h2 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:18px;color:#0b5cab;">What happens next</h2>
<ol style="margin:0 0 24px;padding-left:20px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;"><li style="margin:0 0 10px;">Arrive 15 minutes before your shift and check in at the volunteer table by the main entrance.</li><li style="margin:0 0 10px;">Wear closed-toe shoes; setup includes moving tables and carrying decor.</li><li style="margin:0 0 10px;">You'll get a reminder email two days before the event with parking details.</li></ol>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 0 24px;"><tr><td style="background:#0b5cab;border-radius:8px;">
<a href="https://business-customization-9444.scratch.my.site.com/volunteerslwrvforcesite/" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;color:#ffffff;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;">View your shift</a></td></tr></table>
<p style="margin:0 0 32px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;">Questions? Reply to this email or call the events team at (816) 555-0142.</p>
